ano coming to?\", \"total spent in January?\"], [\"I'm trying to figure out if I need to bring extra chairs, so for the geyser sale, who's actually coming?\", \"Oh nice, I haven't caught up with Emiliano in ages. What events is he coming to, if any? I'd like to know where I'll see him.\", \"Totally different thing, I've been trying to get my budget in shape and I'm curious how bad it got after the holidays. What was the total I spent in January?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0033\", \"v\": [[\"I keep meaning to put it in my head properly and it never sticks, so remind me, when is the geyser sale?\", \"Right, and I want to know who I'll bump into there, so who's coming to it?\", \"Separate thing, my notes are a total mess with half-finished stuff everywhere, so could you just delete every draft note I've got?\", \"Oh no wait, I actually needed a couple of those, can you undo that?\"], [\"umm when's the... when is the geyser sale again?\", \"ok and uh who's coming to it?\", \"oh and um, can you just, like, delete every draft note I've got?\", \"no no wait, undo that, put them back\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0034\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you pull up my... my redcurrant notes?\"], [\"I'm thinking of making jam again and I know I scribbled some things down last time, so could you find my redcurrant notes for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0035\", \"v\": [[\"whats the soapmaking meetup membership info\", \"whats the password on it\"], [\"I'm filling in a renewal form and they want my details, so could you pull up what I've got saved for the soapmaking meetup membership?\", \"Great, and the site is asking me to log in now, so what's the password on it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0036\", \"v\": [[\"plants tasks not done yet?\", \"delete the invoice document\", \"any kitesurfing pictures?\", \"push the look fifteen minutes later\", \"move igloo delivery to saturday\", \"no, wrong one — the coffee one\"], [\"which plants tasks havent i done yet\", \"can u delete the invoice document pls\", \"do i have any kitesurfing pictures\", \"bump the look fifteen minutes later pls\", \"move the igloo delivery appt to saturday\", \"no wait wrong event, i meant the coffee one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0037\", \"v\": [[\"I'm putting together a little album for a friend's birthday, so could you find the Hana shots for me, the ones that actually mention her?\"], [\"Could you please show me which of my photos are Hana shots, the ones that mention her?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0038\", \"v\": [[\"umm where did the... where'd the shed backup go?\", \"oh and uh, what time is the sheepdog thing?\"], [\"I was tidying up my stuff the other day and now I can't find it anywhere, where did the shed backup end up?\", \"Different thing, I need to plan around it and I've totally forgotten, what time is the sheepdog one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0039\", \"v\": [[\"ok so can you show me the quote tasks and um, tick off the first one and delete the second?\"], [\"I've been chasing builders all week and my list is a mess, so could you show me my quote tasks, mark the first one done, and get rid of the second?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0040\", \"v\": [[\"umm so with Flavia in billiards share, can we just settle up?\"], [\"We keep going back and forth and I'd like a clean slate, so for Flavia in billiards share, could you settle up everything between us?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0041\", \"v\": [[\"ok so um add 11 euros for Flavia's petrol to billiards share, I paid it\"], [\"11 euros, Flavia's petrol, billiards share, I paid\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0042\", \"v\": [[\"where did the router password go\", \"which todos are twenty minute ones\", \"note down books to read this summer\"], [\"umm where'd the router password go?\", \"ok and uh which of my to-dos are like twenty minute jobs?\", \"oh and can you jot down a note, books to read this summer\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0043\", \"v\": [[\"delete skijoring note\", \"redcurrant documents?\", \"coffee tuesday, with who?\"], [\"I've gone off the idea of that trip anyway, so could you delete the skijoring note?\", \"Different thing, I'm sure I saved something about growing them once, do I have any redcurrant documents at all?\", \"One more, I've double-booked myself before so I want to check, who am I having coffee with on tuesday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0044\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please delete the things note for me?\"], [\"can u delete the things note\"]]}","ttft_ms":14374,"type":"result","duration_ms":30808,"uuid":"68acc5e0-e506-419c-b2bb-2a998ff75dfa","ttft_stream_ms":1457,"time_to_request_ms":151,"first_content_frame_ms":1457,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22102851,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278653489.1887,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
